---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy — AI Playbook" description="AI Playbook privacy policy, affiliate disclosure, and terms of use.">
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-8"><em>Last updated: June 16, 2026</em></p>

    <div class="prose prose-gray max-w-none">
      <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>
        <strong>We collect minimal personal data.</strong> AI Playbook does not require user accounts.
        We don't ask for your name, email, or personal information to read our content.
      </p>
      <p>We may collect:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Anonymous usage data</strong> via Vercel Analytics (page views, referrer, browser type) — no personal identifiers.</li>
        <li><strong>Search queries</strong> on our site search — stored temporarily for improving results.</li>
        <li><strong>Email address</strong> if you contact us — used only to respond to your inquiry.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Cookies</h2>
      <p>
        We use minimal cookies. Google AdSense uses cookies for ad personalization.
        You can opt out of personalized advertising at
        <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" rel="nofollow">Google Ad Settings</a>.
      </p>
      <p>We do not use:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Tracking cookies for cross-site profiling</li>
        <li>Marketing pixels or retargeting scripts</li>
        <li>Social media tracking widgets</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
      <p>We use the following third-party services:</p>
      <table class="min-w-full border border-gray-200 text-sm">
        <thead>
          <tr class="bg-gray-50">
            <th class="px-4 py-2 border border-gray-200 text-left">Service</th>
            <th class="px-4 py-2 border border-gray-200 text-left">Purpose</th>
            <th class="px-4 py-2 border border-gray-200 text-left">Data Shared</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td class="px-4 py-2 border border-gray-200">Vercel</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-2 border border-gray-200">Hosting and analytics</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-2 border border-gray-200">Anonymous page views</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="px-4 py-2 border border-gray-200">Google AdSense</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-2 border border-gray-200">Advertising</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-2 border border-gray-200">Browser cookies, anonymous usage</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>

      <h2>Affiliate Disclosure</h2>
      <p>
        Some links on AI Playbook are affiliate links. If you click an affiliate link and make a purchase,
        we may earn a small commission at no additional cost to you. This helps us keep the site running
        and our content free.
      </p>
      <p><strong>Our commitment:</strong></p>
      <ul>
        <li>Affiliate relationships <strong>never</strong> influence our ratings, reviews, or recommendations.</li>
        <li>We clearly mark affiliate links where possible.</li>
        <li>We recommend tools we genuinely believe in — regardless of affiliate status.</li>
        <li>Tools we recommend without affiliate programs are clearly noted.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Content Copyright</h2>
      <p>
        All content on AI Playbook is original. &copy; 2026 AI Playbook.
        You may quote or reference our content with proper attribution (link back to the original article).
        Reproduction of full articles without permission is prohibited.
      </p>

      <h2>AI-Generated Content Policy</h2>
      <p>
        We use AI tools as part of our research and drafting process. All content is reviewed and edited
        by a human before publication. Our reviews are based on real, hands-on testing — not AI-generated
        summaries. We disclose our use of AI in our <a href="/about">About page</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Data Retention &amp; Deletion</h2>
      <p>
        We retain anonymous analytics data for up to 26 months (Vercel default). If you email us,
        we retain your email and our correspondence for up to 12 months after the last message.
        To request deletion of your data, email <a href="mailto:privacy@aiplaybook.guide">privacy@aiplaybook.guide</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this privacy policy from time to time. Material changes will be noted on this page
        with an updated date. Continued use of the site after changes constitutes acceptance of the
        updated policy.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        For privacy-related inquiries: <a href="mailto:privacy@aiplaybook.guide">privacy@aiplaybook.guide</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
